<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} modDatetime={new Date("2026-06-09T00:00:00Z")} structuredData={schemaGraph}>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center">
    <section class="relative flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#0f172a] pt-20 pb-28 text-white lg:pt-28 lg:pb-36" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22), transparent 45%);">
      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
          <span>Independent SafeLink Wireless 2026 Guide • Last updated {displayDate}</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-4xl leading-tight font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          SafeLink Wireless Free Tablet 2026: <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-blue-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Eligibility & Options</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium text-blue-100 sm:text-xl">
          SafeLink Wireless is widely searched for free phone, tablet, BYOP, and Lifeline service options. Tablet availability is not guaranteed and can depend on ZIP code, state rules, eligibility, coverage, current provider inventory, plan terms, shipping, activation, and possible fees. This guide explains SafeLink Wireless tablet options, EBT/Medicaid eligibility, BYOP, documents, application steps, order status, customer service, and safer provider comparisons.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-5 sm:flex-row">
          <a href={officialSafeLinkUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-emerald-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-500 sm:w-auto">Apply Now on Official Site</a>
          <a href="/eligibility/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 sm:w-auto">Check Eligibility First</a>
        </div>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-blue-200/70">
          FreeTablet.click is independent. We are not SafeLink Wireless, TracFone, Verizon, FCC, USAC, Lifeline, National Verifier, or a government agency. We do not approve applications, ship devices, or manage SafeLink accounts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quick-answer" class="w-full border-b border-border bg-emerald-50/60 py-14">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-emerald-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-emerald-600 uppercase">Quick Answer</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Quick Answer: Does SafeLink Wireless Offer Free Tablets in 2026?</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">
            <p>SafeLink Wireless is mainly known for Lifeline-supported phone service and BYOP-style options. Tablet offers may appear in some situations, but a SafeLink Wireless free tablet is not guaranteed for every applicant. Availability depends on your ZIP code, state rules, eligibility, coverage, current provider inventory, plan terms, shipping, activation, and possible fees.</p>
            <p>Always confirm current terms on the official SafeLink Wireless website before submitting personal information. You can also review <a href="/eligibility/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">SafeLink Wireless eligibility</a>, learn <a href="/how-to-apply/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">how to apply for a free tablet</a>, <a href="/states/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">check tablet availability by state</a>, compare the <a href="/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">free government tablet guide</a>, <a href="/airtalk-wireless/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">compare AirTalk Wireless tablet options</a>, <a href="/assurance-wireless/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">compare Assurance Wireless tablet options</a>, and <a href="/standup-wireless/" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">compare StandUp Wireless options</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quick-facts" class="w-full bg-muted/30 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">SafeLink Wireless Quick Facts</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">A factual snapshot without fake ratings, fake reviews, or guaranteed tablet claims.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
              {quickFacts.map((fact) => (
                <tr>
                  <th class="w-1/3 bg-muted/40 px-5 py-4 font-bold text-foreground">{fact.label}</th>
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">{fact.value}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="legit" class="w-full border-t border-border bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-8">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-emerald-600 uppercase">Legitimacy check</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Is SafeLink Wireless Legit?</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">SafeLink Wireless is a real Lifeline-related wireless provider brand, but users should still use only the official SafeLink website, verify the URL, read plan terms, and avoid fake pages promising guaranteed tablets, guaranteed phones, instant approval, or fake government branding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-5 lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Use official pages only</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Start with the <a href={officialSafeLinkUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">SafeLink Wireless official website</a> and avoid lookalike pages, social ads, or forms promising guaranteed tablets.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Verify Lifeline eligibility</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Lifeline eligibility may be based on income or qualifying programs. Most states use National Verifier handling, while state-specific rules can still apply.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Avoid guarantee claims</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Be careful with “free tablet guaranteed,” “free phone guaranteed,” “instant approval,” or fake government branding unless the current official SafeLink terms clearly support the offer.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tablet-options" class="w-full border-y border-border bg-slate-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
